@baseUrl = https://localhost:7226
@csrfToken = <fresh authenticated CSRF token>
@accountId = <account ID from the authorized invitation list>
@gymId = 2

### GymAdmin invites a Trainer; send the validated session cookies
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/invitations
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "trainer-invitation-001",
  "email": "trainer@example.invalid",
  "role": 2
}

### GymAdmin or Trainer invites the selected active Student ficha in their session gym
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/invitations
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "student-invitation-001",
  "email": "student-login@example.invalid",
  "role": 3,
  "studentId": 23
}

### Missing or foreign ficha returns the same 404 without account creation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/invitations
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "missing-student-001",
  "email": "student-login@example.invalid",
  "role": 3,
  "studentId": 2147483647
}

### Bodyless existing lifecycle route also suspends an explicitly linked Student login
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/students/23/deactivate
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Restores only ficha-derived suspension; does not restore old sessions or activate pending identities
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/students/23/reactivate
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### List persisted Student invitation states (GymAdmin or Trainer); no CSRF header required
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/invitations?role=3&offset=0&pageSize=25

### List Trainer invitation states (GymAdmin only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/invitations?role=2&offset=0&pageSize=25

### Replace a Student link after one hour from last queueing; an earlier attempt returns 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/invitations/{{accountId}}/resend?role=3
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Immediately cancel Student links without changing the account or ficha; repeats return 204
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/invitations/{{accountId}}/cancel?role=3
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Missing or foreign account returns generic 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/invitations/unknown/resend?role=3
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### SuperAdmin session only: list GymAdmin invitation states in the selected gym
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/gyms/{{gymId}}/administrators/invitations?offset=0&pageSize=25

### SuperAdmin session only: existing resend route, now with the same one-hour cooldown
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/gyms/{{gymId}}/administrators/{{accountId}}/invitation
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### SuperAdmin session only: cancel GymAdmin links without deleting the gym or account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/gyms/{{gymId}}/administrators/{{accountId}}/invitation/cancel
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### A deliberate new tenant invitation after cancellation requires a new key and the same target, after cooldown
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/invitations
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "student-invitation-002",
  "email": "student-login@example.invalid",
  "role": 3,
  "studentId": 23
}
